        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL ARCADE, 44, Oldham-street, Manchester. (Next to the Adelphl Bank),</p>
        <p>LATE the PROPERTY of a SCHOOLMASTER. A Charming House of Furniture, really like new. It consists of dining r{,om sAte in leather, extending dining table, carpet, rug, fender, fire bias-es, laae curtains, window pole complete, magnificent bedroo.n suite (not paintad, solid wood), enclo-ed dre•sing-table, large bevelled glass attached; enclo-ed washstand, marble 51-. b, tile back, and bevelled shav- ing mirror, they form to complete chest of dra sera; full-size handzome bleak and brass bed. lad, wire spring mattress, bed, bolster, pilloas, sheets, b'ankets, pillow slips, bolster cases, toilet set, carpet, complete furniture for kitchen, floor- cloth for same, ditta for lobby and -tars. Call 'aid inspect the lot. Get a complete list, and you will say they are a marvel of cheapness for 24 guineas, orb per cent extra on the deferred payment system.</p>
        <p>GERSHON, UNIVERSAL FURNISHING ARCADE. 44, Oldham-street, Manchester, next to the Adelphi Bank.</p>
        <p>LATE THE PROPERTY OF A POSTMA6TER. Another complete home, well worthy the attention of those about furnieh!ng, all made by a noted maker; dining- room ,dmwlng-roozn,three bedrooms complete and kitchen.any amount of sundries, all guaranteed, condition is spotless, call and see them, packed, warranted, and delivered for £3B, or 5 per cent. extra if on the deferred payment system.</p>
        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL FURNISHING ARCADE, 44, Oldham-street, Manchester, next to the Adelphi Bank.</p>
        <p>LATE THE PROPERTY OF A DOCTOR AT HIGHER BROUGHTON. This lot was let on hire by a house who charged £175 for them ; the lot wants Leeing to effect a speedy Bale; magnifi- cent dining-room in solid walnut (the sideboard is well worth £25). the dr-wing-room in inlAid rosewood, the bedrooms are In satin walnut wood and American walnut, grand bedsteads, oil painting, kitchen furniture, dinner set, and sundries; space prevents anything like a complete list, call to see them. Don't forget they were sent out on hire for £175 ; my price, £5B, or 5 per cent. extra on the deferred payment system.</p>
