        <p>LATE THE PROPERTY OF A CLERGYMAN. Such a nice smart Dining Room in Leather: Small chairs (padded back), couch, and easy chairs to match, solid frames, spring stuffed, a dead bargain for £5 15s ; handsome side- board to match, with bevelled glass back, £4 18s. ; extending dining table, to match with extra leaf,3Bs.; large size carpet, bordered, and rug to mate:, 285.; overmantel, a perfect beauty, 305.; fender, dogs; and tire brasses, 18s, the lot; or the entire dining-room kt as above for £l6 74„ or five per cent extra on the deferred payment system.</p>
        <p>GIHISHON'S UNIVBRSAL FURNISHING ARCADII, 44, Oldham-street, Manchester, next to the Adolph' Bank</p>
        <p>LATE TUE PROPERTY OF MRs. WOODWIN. A charming Suite.which I have re-covered in handsome saddle bags; the woodwork is second hand, covering new small chairs, easy chairs, and couch,all to match; worth £l5; price now, £5 15s. Cabinet, T-ble, and Overmantel to match, making a charming lot for very little money, Add 5 per cent. if °utile deferred payment system.</p>
        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL FURNISHING ARCADE. 44, Oldham-street, Mmchester next to the A.delphi Bank</p>
        <p>T_AATE THE PROPERTY OF A BANKRUPT SILK MERCHANT. Without doubt the handsomest fittings for a dining-roam ever seen. Money cannot buy better. The small chairs are most handsomely carved. The lounge chairs and couch are all upholstered in a real crocodile leather, everlasting wear. The handsome sideboard. overmantel. and large extending dining table are all in dark (nearly black) Chippendale maho- gany. I am informed they cost nearly £200; can uoW be had for 68 guineas. I have also the drawing room, which is simply magnificent, and a number of bedroom suites. One suite is in real satinwood, richly inlaid, and I know for a positive fact it coat two years since 250 guineas, and is now on offer for 85 guineas. Another massive suite in solid wal- nutwood cannot be de3cribed, it's quite equal to new, in fact. better, it cost £9s—the invoice is in my poseession—can now be had for 55 guineas, warranted and delivered.</p>
